ories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aIhtllXff_ByakFmBqClpQ","review_id":"QVsrl0YCbRVE9rqAnafsoQ","date":"2020-06-18T17:59:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9444020986557007,"text_excerpt":"Found Jeanae on Google when I was searching for custom cookies. Easy and efficient ordering process - filled out a form online describing what I'd like, chose a delivery date 4 days later, received an email and invoice within 1 day confirming my order, and paid online. I experienced no problems and I appreciated the quick turnaround! I chose my shape and design from cookies featured on her Instagram account, but from what I can tell she can make almost any shape, etc. that you want! The whole process was much easier than going to a bakery in person (especially during COVID times) and the pricing was super reasonable. It cost roughly $20 for 12 cookies (packed as 2 cookies per individually..."},{"business_id":"aIhtllXff_ByakFmBqClpQ","review_id":"VMR1kkrSWzP7ug7OGMN18Q","date":"2018-03-24T23:09:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.927727222442627,"text_excerpt":"After a number of cookie makers were not available, a friend recommended JCB for my specialty cookie need. With less than a week to the event, their Baker was happy to help!! They had great options to make our cookies beautiful and follow our theme. The cookies were beautiful and a huge hit with our dance krewe membership. They also offered online billing and payment which made things much easier. Great bakery!! I'll definitely be using them often."},{"business_id":"aIhtllXff_ByakFmBqClpQ","review_id":"7IiRLYyR-NoOUhea8FSgiw","date":"2017-04-05T19:18:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9037500023841858,"text_excerpt":"This is the best deal in town for decorated party cookies. Can't beat the price and quality. Super fast, too. She has helped me with two last minute (four or five days out) needs. I have ordered cookies from her four times now."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
